s them with an extension — a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every key is in the default group."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"code":"Options.tagPrefix","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation."}],"title":"KeychainKeyStore","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/persistent":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/persistent","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"persistent","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/persistent","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Keep keys in the Keychain, across launches. Off, they live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only as long as this store (for tests: the Keychain needs a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"signed host app on iOS).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"persistent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/batchSize":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchSize"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"title":"batchSize","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/batchsize","abstract":[{"text":"How many copies of each credential to request when an issuer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offers batches, each bound to its own key, so each presentation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can use one no Verifier has seen. 0 means the SDK’s default (5);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s capped at the issuer’s batch size.","type":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderUserPresence":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text",